    // PLACEHOLDERS for Milestone 1 (backlog K tunes them). Effects fire when their phase reaches offsetMs (R-3.1-07).
    // Fields a kind does not use are 0, "" or "none". Strikes and projectiles deal damage (damagePercent: the skill multiplier
    // of R-3.4-04 on Atk for "physical", Matk for "magic"); a projectile names its ProjectileDef (D3).
    // Version 2 (D6) added optional fields, left out where they keep their default: "element" ("none"; strikes, projectiles
    // and ground areas, R-3.4-07), "targets" (self, allies, enemies: heals, statuses, ground areas, R-3.1-07), "healPercent"
    // (of the caster's Matk) and "statusKind" (a RemoveStatus by kind: "buff" strips, "debuff" cleanses). Heals and status
    // effects that reach others have HitShapeDef rows; self-only ones have none.
    // "directionOffsetDeg" (optional, default 0; backlog E): a dash moves along the locked facing turned by it, clockwise in
    // whole degrees (180: the Archer's Back Step). Every hit carries poise damage and a flinch (R-3.1-08).
    // "dashDirection" (optional, default "facing"): "facing" moves a dash along the locked facing turned by
    // directionOffsetDeg; "moveInput" along the movement keys held on the tick the action starts, and with no key held along
    // the locked facing turned by directionOffsetDeg.
    // WP11 (D6) added more optional fields, without a version change: "buildUpReduction" (RemoveStatus and Heal: every
    // build-up meter of each target loses that many points, R-3.8-04) and "visualId" (a ground area's EntityVisualDef row;
    // empty: the placeholder drawn from its shapes). A ground area deals damagePercent/damageKind per tick to enemies (never flinches, R-3.3-09) and
    // heals healPercent per tick with self or allies. Build-up changes per hit are EffectBuildUpDef rows (spec 3.8).

